  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transformative Agenda for Sexual Reproductive Health in the Pacific Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2 - Funding under this investment supports the United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) Pacific Sub-regional Office&apos;s Transformative Agenda for Women, Adolescents and Youth in the Pacific, reducing unmet need for family planning towards zero. Outcomes from the program include: increased and improved supply of integrated sexual and reproductive health (SRH) information and services, particularly for family planning; increased demand for integrated SRH information and services, particularly for family planning; and more conducive and supportive environment for people to access and benefit from quality SRH, especially contraceptive choice.</narrative>
  </description>
